  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can survive terrifying wounds that would kill others.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Resilient Brute<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat whenever you take damage, not only when a critical hit is confirmed against you. You can also use it more than once per day by expending two uses of mythic power for each additional use. If the attack against you was made by a non-mythic creature, you may treat 75% of the damage as nonlethal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
